sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Agent as Field Agent
    participant UI as Task UI / ViewModel
    participant Repo as Task & Photo Repositories
    participant File as Disk Storage (filesDir/task_photos/{userId})
    participant DB as Room DB (Tasks, Photos, SyncQueue)
    participant WM as WorkManager (SyncWorker)
    participant API as Standalone SQLite Mock API (mock_server.db)

    Agent->>UI: Create/Edit Task & Capture Photo
    UI->>Repo: saveTaskWithPhoto(task, tempPhoto)
    Repo->>File: Write bytes to temp -> flush -> atomic rename to photo_{photoId}.jpg
    File-->>Repo: Local File Path Confirmed

    Repo->>DB: Atomic @Transaction (insert TaskEntity + PhotoEvidenceEntity + SyncQueueEntity)
    Note over DB: Task sync_status = PENDING<br/>SyncQueue status = PENDING<br/>Operation ID = operationId
    DB-->>UI: Flow emits instant UI state (SSOT)
    UI-->>Agent: Task displayed instantly with "Sync Pending" badge

    Repo->>WM: enqueueUniqueWork("StoreVisitSyncWork", KEEP, ...)

    alt Network Offline
        WM-->>Repo: Network unavailable constraint. Wait for connectivity.
        Note over Agent,DB: All tasks and photos safely persisted in Room & File Storage.
    else Network Online
        WM->>DB: Query pending operations from SyncQueue for active userId
        DB-->>WM: Return pending operations list (with operationId)

        loop For each pending operation
            WM->>API: POST /tasks/sync (with Bearer Token & X-Client-Operation-Id)
            Note over API: Mock Backend checks processed_operations table in mock_server.db

            alt Operation New (Not Processed)
                API->>API: Execute mutation & insert operationId into processed_operations
                API-->>WM: Return HTTP 200/201 Success Envelope (succeededOperationIds)
                WM->>DB: Atomic @Transaction (Update sync_status = SYNCED, remove/complete SyncQueue item)
            else Operation Replayed (Already Processed)
                API-->>WM: Return HTTP 200 Success Envelope (cached result)
                WM->>DB: Atomic @Transaction (Update sync_status = SYNCED, remove SyncQueue item)
            else HTTP 401 Session Expired
                API-->>WM: Return HTTP 401 Unauthorized
                WM->>DB: Invalidate active token in TokenManager
                Note over DB,UI: CRITICAL: Local tasks and photo files are preserved!
                WM-->>UI: Broadcast Session Expired -> Redirect to Login
            else Transient Error (500 / Network Timeout)
                API-->>WM: Network Failure / HTTP 500
                WM->>DB: Update task sync_status = SYNC_FAILED, increment retryCount
                WM-->>WM: Schedule Exponential Backoff Retry
            end
        end
        DB-->>UI: Flow emits updated sync status
        UI-->>Agent: UI badge updates to "Synced" or "Sync Failed"
    end
